■ 프림의 MST(욕심쟁이 방법): 인접행렬을 기반으로 하여 복잡도는 복잡도: Θ(n^2)
[0000]    void prim_MST_2(int graph[][MAX], int n, int s) {
[0001]        bool MST_V[MAX] ;
[0002]        int distance[MAX], nearest[MAX], i, u, w;
[0003]        for (i = 0; i<n; i++)  { // 초기화 
[0004]            MST_V[i] = false; 
[0005]            distance[i] = graph[s][i];
[0006]            nearest[i] = s;
[0007]        }
[0008]        MST_V[s] = true;
[0009]        loop (n-2) { // n-2번 반복
[0010]            u = select_min(distance, n, MST_V);
[0011]            MST_V[u] = true;
[0012]            for (w = 0; w<n; w++)
[0013]                if (MST_V[w] == false) {
[0014]                    if (graph[u][w]<distance[w]) {
[0015]                        distance[w] = graph[u][w];
[0016]                        nearest[w] = u;
[0017]                    }
[0018]                }
[0019]            }
[0020]        }
[0021]    }
[0022]    
[0023]    int select_min(int distance[], int n, bool MST_V[]) {
[0024]        int i, min = ∞, min_index = 0;
[0025]        for (i = 0; i < n; i++) {
[0026]            if (distance[i]<min && MST_V[i]==false) {
[0027]                min = distance[i];
[0028]                min_index = i;
[0029]            }
[0030]        }
[0031]        return min_index;
[0032]    }
